GroovyGrab core licensing
=========================

This repository contains components under multiple licenses. The notice in each
source file is authoritative and is not replaced by this summary. Nothing here
relicenses any file.

Files marked GPL version 2 or later, such as Groovy.sv and sys/sys_top.v, are
available under that license. See licenses/GPL-2.0.txt.

Files marked GPL version 3 or later are available under that license. See
licenses/GPL-3.0.txt. They include:

- sys/hps_io.sv, sys/ddr_svc.sv, sys/scandoubler.v and sys/sd_card.sv
- rtl/JTFRAME
- rtl/lz4.v, rtl/ddram.sv and rtl/hps_ext.v

Files with no license notice come from upstream Groovy_MiSTer or the MiSTer
template, whose repositories include the GPL version 2 text, and are provided on
those terms. See licenses/GPL-2.0.txt.

sys/ascal.vhd and the files generated by Quartus keep their own notices.

A built core combines these files, including ones under GPL version 3 or later,
so GroovyGrab distributes built cores under GPL version 3.
